WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.760
Fill a basket with 10 to 12 things from around the house.

2
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.720
Mix a rock, a toy car, a dry leaf, an apple, and a houseplant.

3
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.140
Add one or two large dry beans.

4
00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:18.353
Ask your child to sort everything into two piles, alive and not alive.

5
00:00:18.953 --> 00:00:21.433
Ask how they decided, and write down their rule.

6
00:00:22.053 --> 00:00:23.193
Do not correct it yet.

7
00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:28.213
Next, build a checklist from a pet or plant, and test each object.

8
00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:32.427
Spend the most time on the seed, the toy car, and the dry leaf.

9
00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.547
It is fine to leave a question open.

10
00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:36.367
Stay with your child.

11
00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:40.107
Keep beans and other small objects away from children under four.

12
00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.327
Nothing from the basket is for eating.
